      "locked": false,
      "text": "边界契约：Pydantic DTO / CanonicalEvent / Repository interface / Provider interface / Facade；禁止跨边界传 ORM session、SDK 原始对象、进程内可变全局。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=未来物理拆分，红虚线=信任边界。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontString": "13px Helvetica",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "边界契约：Pydantic DTO / CanonicalEvent / Repository interface / Provider interface / Facade；禁止跨边界传 ORM session、SDK 原始对象、进程内可变全局。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=未来物理拆分，红虚线=信任边界。",
