      "updated": 1786079880693,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1-15 已实现：基础 runtime、精确 OpenAPI、Docker secret、tenant cache、canonical trace/event schema 与 local state upgrader；0014 提供 model/embedding usage evidence、durable settlement、evidence outbox 与 event capacity reservation；0015 提供受控 DelegationService 与 durable aggregation；0016 提供 shared parent execution-tree budget；HTTP SSE 与 CLI NDJSON 共用 canonical bytes reader、可见 cursor、受限分页和 terminal EOF。Phase 14 已补齐维护文档/ADR，Phase 15 已建立双 CI、release automation 与 license/compliance gate。当前未来边界仅包括 WS、独立 tool/model gateway、event pipeline、storage service、RLS 与多 executor 协调；紫色虚线=P1+ 拆分。",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontString": "11px Helvetica",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1-15 已实现：基础 runtime、精确 OpenAPI、Docker secret、tenant cache、canonical trace/event schema 与 local state upgrader；0014 提供 model/embedding usage evidence、durable settlement、evidence outbox 与 event capacity reservation；0015 提供受控 DelegationService 与 durable aggregation；0016 提供 shared parent execution-tree budget；HTTP SSE 与 CLI NDJSON 共用 canonical bytes reader、可见 cursor、受限分页和 terminal EOF。Phase 14 已补齐维护文档/ADR，Phase 15 已建立双 CI、release automation 与 license/compliance gate。当前未来边界仅包括 WS、独立 tool/model gateway、event pipeline、storage service、RLS 与多 executor 协调；紫色虚线=P1+ 拆分。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15,
      "index": "b5K",
      "autoResize": true
    },
